[22.406508, "o", "public: local integrity verified (T1/T2/T4); 1 tail(s); all events are signature-covered; 1 \r\nbackup key(s), which sign nothing until restored (see census — informational, not a break); \r\nexternal witness (T3): not covered — nothing outside this machine attests this record\r\n  census [backup-key] public \r\nc6d1d0e32b7803f67022f53d36c207b5e60c2152385e454c516a2964f461c12b: the backup key this machine \r\nregistered for mnid:22d03c71c66022aff6fc386f2d39f6c0819638847d0e932bf9289f5b6ed54b35 — a \r\nbackup signs nothing until it is restored, so it has no tail (if it was restored and has \r\nsigned, that tail is not here)\r\nprivate: no record here — nothing has been written to this tree on this machine, so there \r\nis nothing to rule on\r\n"]
